# Cloudflare Pages routing for a single-page app.
#
# Without this, every route except "/" is a 404 on refresh or on a shared link.
# Pages serves files, and there is no file at /timeline: the Angular router
# creates that path in the browser after index.html has loaded. The 200 status
# is the part that matters, because a 301 would change the URL and the router
# would never see the original path.
#
# Assets are hashed and served from real files, so they match before this rule
# and are unaffected.
/*    /index.html   200
